OL,3,GNEWSANew bypass on landslip-hit route
OL,4,Aopens to traffic
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major new road in North Yorkshire has
OL,7,Fofficially opened to traffic, three
OL,8,Fyears after construction began.
OL,10,FThe #82m Kex Gill bypass near
OL,11,FBlubberhouses replaced a section of the
OL,12,FA59 which had seen 15 landslips since
OL,13,F2000, forcing it to close on a number
OL,14,Fof occasions.
OL,16,FThe road is seen as a vital connection
OL,17,Fbetween Harrogate and Skipton, linking
OL,18,Fthe east and west of England.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
