OL,3,GNEWSANew bypass on landslip-hit route
OL,4,Aopens to traffic
OL,5,
OL,6,FMalcolm Taylor, who oversees highways
OL,7,Fat North Yorkshire Council, said the
OL,8,Froute would "bring major benefits for
OL,9,Fcommunities in the county".
